WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:03.200
-Ryan, you and I both agree
that people do a lot of things

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.634
that they have to stop doing.
-Yeah.

00:00:04.634 --> 00:00:06.734
-So, with that in mind, it's
time for "You Have To Stop."

00:00:06.734 --> 00:00:07.968
-Yeah.

00:00:07.968 --> 00:00:11.701
-♪ Doo-boo-do-bo-do,
you have to stop ♪

00:00:11.701 --> 00:00:13.167
-Hey.

00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:16.701
You have to stop making plans
with me one month in advance.

00:00:16.701 --> 00:00:19.000
I'm gonna say yes
because that does sound fun,

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.067
but when the day comes,
you know I'm gonna cancel

00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:23.567
with some made-up excuse like,
"I'm not feeling well."

00:00:23.567 --> 00:00:25.434
And that's not true.
I'm feeling great.

00:00:25.434 --> 00:00:27.400
I just don't want
to leave my house tonight.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.000
You have to stop.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.000
[ Applause ]

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.434
-You have to stop whispering,
"That looks good,"

00:00:33.434 --> 00:00:35.868
at the movies
after every trailer.

00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:37.000
"Oh, that looks good."

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.467
We know it looks good.
That's --

00:00:38.467 --> 00:00:41.834
That's the job of the trailer,
to make the movie look good.

00:00:41.834 --> 00:00:44.267
Even bad movies
have good trailers.

00:00:44.267 --> 00:00:45.501
I've been in some of them.

00:00:45.501 --> 00:00:48.000
It's not impressive
when a trailer looks good.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.033
They all look good. Stop.

00:00:50.033 --> 00:00:51.267
Stop.

00:00:51.267 --> 00:00:53.934
[ Applause ]

00:00:53.934 --> 00:00:56.567
-You have to stop
checking TikTok real quick

00:00:56.567 --> 00:00:58.234
before trying to fall asleep.

00:00:58.234 --> 00:01:00.400
Oh, you got in bed
before midnight? Congrats.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.267
Oh, you're checking TikTok
real quick?

00:01:02.267 --> 00:01:04.334
Well, now it's 2:00 a.m.,
and you're watching

00:01:04.334 --> 00:01:06.901
Ring Doorbell videos
of mailmen being surprised

00:01:06.901 --> 00:01:08.734
with a basket of Clif bars.

00:01:08.734 --> 00:01:11.767
So just stop. Please.

00:01:11.767 --> 00:01:16.167
-Yeah. You have to stop
daylight saving time.

00:01:16.167 --> 00:01:18.801
We're not farmers anymore.

00:01:18.801 --> 00:01:21.133
The only thing
I've ever successfully grown

00:01:21.133 --> 00:01:24.567
was this beautifully,
perfectly manicured beard.

00:01:24.567 --> 00:01:28.234
And guess what. My kids don't
know what daylight savings is,

00:01:28.234 --> 00:01:30.033
and now they're getting up
at 4:00 a.m.,

00:01:30.033 --> 00:01:31.834
and I have to tell them
it's because of farmers.

00:01:31.834 --> 00:01:33.801
So now my kids hate farmers.

00:01:33.801 --> 00:01:35.133
I mean, you're creating

00:01:35.133 --> 00:01:38.033
generations of kids
who hate farmers.

00:01:38.033 --> 00:01:39.467
You have to stop!

00:01:39.467 --> 00:01:43.100
[ Applause ]

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:45.133
-You have to stop
posting screenshots

00:01:45.133 --> 00:01:47.701
with your phone battery on 1%.

00:01:47.701 --> 00:01:49.300
I'm not looking
at what you posted.

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:52.033
I'm looking to see that
your phone needs to be charged!

00:01:52.033 --> 00:01:54.267
Where are you?! Do you have
access to a phone charger?

00:01:54.267 --> 00:01:55.501
Do you need to borrow one?

00:01:55.501 --> 00:01:57.634
I'm sending help.
But you need to stop.

00:01:57.634 --> 00:02:00.267
[ Applause ]

00:02:00.267 --> 00:02:02.701
-And, you know, you have to stop
spending over ten minutes

00:02:02.701 --> 00:02:04.767
scrolling for a TV show
or movie to watch.

00:02:04.767 --> 00:02:06.567
I mean, if --
if you can't figure it out

00:02:06.567 --> 00:02:10.467
after that amount of time,
you're never going to.

00:02:10.467 --> 00:02:12.367
Just put on "The Great
British Baking Show"

00:02:12.367 --> 00:02:14.434
and call it a night.
That's what it's there for.

00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:18.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:18.133 --> 00:02:22.100
-You have to stop bringing back
the McRib, McDonald's.

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:23.934
It's not that the McRib is bad.

00:02:23.934 --> 00:02:26.234
It's that you take it away,
and then you bring it back.

00:02:26.234 --> 00:02:27.601
What if you did that
with other items?

00:02:27.601 --> 00:02:30.033
"Sorry. No hamburgers
till next April.

00:02:30.033 --> 00:02:31.801
This month, it's just fries."

00:02:31.801 --> 00:02:33.534
That's no way
to run a restaurant.

00:02:33.534 --> 00:02:35.734
So just leave the McRib
and please focus on something

00:02:35.734 --> 00:02:38.501
more important like fixing
your ice-cream machines.

00:02:38.501 --> 00:02:42.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:43.601
-And, you know,
you have to stop saying

00:02:43.601 --> 00:02:45.334
that you're gonna move to Canada

00:02:45.334 --> 00:02:48.267
whenever you're mad
at something in the U.S.

00:02:48.267 --> 00:02:53.000
As a Canadian,
I'm "sorry," but, no, you can't.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:56.534
I know we're friendly, but
Canada's not your safe house.

00:02:56.534 --> 00:02:59.133
I mean, we barely let Canadians
into Canada anymore.

00:02:59.133 --> 00:03:01.968
So please...pick somewhere else.

00:03:01.968 --> 00:03:05.334
I hear -- I hear Finland is
really lovely this time of year.

00:03:05.334 --> 00:03:07.167
You have to stop.

00:03:07.167 --> 00:03:09.067
-This has been
"You Have To Stop."

00:03:09.067 --> 00:03:10.467
My thanks to Ryan Reynolds.

